{"slug":"n-f-d","ar":"ن ف د","total":5,"core":"exhaustion; running out","forms":[{"ar":"نَفِدَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":4,"gloss":"to be exhausted, run out","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":96,"p":3,"ar":["مَا","عِندَكُمْ","يَنفَدُ ۖ","وَمَا","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","بَاقٍ ۗ","وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","صَبَرُوٓا۟","أَجْرَهُم","بِأَحْسَنِ","مَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"Whatever you have will end, but what Allah has is lasting. And We will surely give those who were patient their reward according to the best of what they used to do"}},{"ar":"نَّفَاد","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"depletion, ending","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":54,"p":7,"ar":["إِنَّ","هَـٰذَا","لَرِزْقُنَا","مَا","لَهُۥ","مِن","نَّفَادٍ"],"en":"Indeed, this is Our provision; for it there is no depletion"}}],"surahs":[[18,2],[16,1],[31,1],[38,1]]}